On brownwoodbarndos.com, "Call Today! 325-203-2896" in the hero is plain text=
, so on a phone it can't be tapped; the homepage has no call link at all.

I'm Nathanael from Northframe, a website design studio. I built a private con=
cept for Brownwood Barndominiums, with a call button on every screen and your=
